<title>USA: Wicomico Cty, Md., won by Legg Mason.</title>
<headline>Wicomico Cty, Md., won by Legg Mason.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker, Inc., said it won $6.250 million of Wicomico Cty, Md., general obligation public improvement bonds, of 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.39 percent.</p>
</text>
